Not covered by these licences: the Reina-Valera 1960 verses (© Sociedades Bíblicas en
América Latina, 1960; renewed © Sociedades Bíblicas Unidas, 1988). Until its publisher's
written permission is granted they are kept privately: not in builds, not to be published
or redistributed (a copy of crates/cantus-ui/locales/verses/es.txt is not covered either).
The Spanish verses Cantus shows are the public-domain Reina-Valera 1909; the other verse
files are public domain too (see crates/cantus-ui/locales/verses/README.md).

